      "quote": "A\nALGORITHM FOR TOG\nWe summarize the comprehensive algorithmic procedure of ToG and ToG-R, as shown in Figure\nAlgorithm 1 and 2.\nAlgorithm 1 ToG\nRequire: Input x, LLM π, depth limit Dmax sam-\nple limit N.\nInitialize E0 ←Extract entities on x, P ←[],\nM ←0.\nwhile D ≤Dmax do\nRD\ncand, Pcand ←Search(x, ED−1, P)\nRD, P ←Prune(π, x, RD\ncand, Pcand)\nED\ncand, Pcand ←Search(x, ED−1, RD, P)\nED, P ←Prune(π, x, ED\ncand, Pcand)\nif Reasoning(π, x, P) then\nGenerate(π, x, P)\nbreak\nend if\nIncrement D by 1.\nend while\nif D > Dmax then\nGenerate(π, x)\nend if\nAlgorithm 2 ToG-R\nRequire: Input x, LLM π, depth limit Dmax sam-\nple limit N.\nInitialize E0 ←Extract entities on x, P ←[],\nM ←0.\nwhile D ≤Dmax do\nRD\ncand, Pcand ←Search(x, ED−1, P)\nRD, P ←Prune(π, x, RD\ncand, Pcand)\nED\ncand, Pcand ←Search(x, ED−1, RD, P)\nif Reasoning(π, x, P, ED\ncand) then\nGenerate(π, x, P, ED\ncand)\nbreak\nend if\nED, P ←Random_Prune(ED\ncand, Pcand)\nIncrement D by 1.\nend while\nif D > Dmax then\nGenerate(π, x)\nend if\n",
